# Final Definition of Done

A request like:

> **"Show me my alerts"**

should become visibly traceable as:

```text
✓ USER REQUEST
        ↓
✓ INTENT: ALERTS
        ↓
✓ AGENT: AlertAgent
        ↓
✓ GET /api/alerts
        ↓
✓ 3 ALERTS RETRIEVED
        ↓
✓ DATA PROCESSED
        ↓
✓ OLLAMA PROMPT CREATED
        ↓
✓ OLLAMA RESPONSE
        ↓
✓ RESPONSE PARSED
        ↓
✓ CHAT UI RENDERED
```

And if something fails:

```text
✓ USER REQUEST
✓ INTENT
✓ AGENT
✓ /api/alerts
✗ /api/alerts → 500
```

with the debug panel immediately showing **why it failed, what request was made, what response came back, and which stage stopped the pipeline**.

**We should implement this commit-by-commit rather than trying to change the entire AI system in one commit.**
